#, python-format
msgid ""
"Deleting your account will permanently forfeit %(count)s unpaid referral "
"payout(s) totalling %(total)s %(currency)s, of which %(failed)s %(currency)s "
"comes from failed transfers. Contact support before deleting if you want "
"these paid out, or re-submit with force=true to delete anyway."
msgstr ""
"Al eliminar tu cuenta perderás definitivamente %(count)s pago(s) de "
"referidos pendiente(s), por un total de %(total)s %(currency)s, de los "
"cuales %(failed)s %(currency)s provienen de transferencias fallidas. Ponte "
"en contacto con soporte antes de eliminarla si quieres cobrarlos, o vuelve a "
"enviar la solicitud con force=true para eliminarla de todas formas."

